below, please let us know so we can adjust prior to posting.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Reason:</span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Reclassification</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><a id=\"OWAAM936081FAE3B545E48151F2F466EBD301\" href=\"mailto:Cristy.Marsh@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Cristy Marsh</span></a> please let Katie know next steps for the position in terms of posting and filling.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Title:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Perioperative Educator</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">PL/CC/JC</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">PL21 &nbsp;/ CC 6600 &nbsp;/ JC 1319</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:16.55pt\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Grade:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">N6</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Salary Range:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">$75,670.40 - $121,076.80</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FLSA:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Exempt/Salaried</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">License:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">RN</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">No</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Direct Supervision:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FTE:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">1.0 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Reports to:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Director of Surgical Services</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Position Summary:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Perioperative Educator is a registered nurse who is clinically competent in the surgical setting and demonstrates expanded roles of nursing in expert patient care delivery, education, consultation, research application and utilization, and leadership/administration. The Educator will design and implement educational programs for the clinical departments within surgical services, and support orientation, on-going education and competency requirements for all staff in their specialty areas. Expectations include promoting excellence in patient care delivery, supporting and facilitating professional growth and development and upholding standards of professionalism. The Educator will collaborate with the TidalHealth Education Department to ensure the department is aware of all educational requirements and needs. They will also provide staffing coverage as needed, including RN and Charge RN.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Education:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Graduate from an accredited School of Nursing, BSN, required.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Certification/Licensure:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Licensed and currently registered to practice as a Registered Nurse in the State of Maryland or Delaware. </span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">BLS required. </span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">BLS instructor certification required within 1 year of hire.</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">CNOR preferred, required within one (1) year of hire.</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">ACLS preferred.</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">PALS preferred.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Experience:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><a name=\"_Hlk215476528\"></a>Minimum of three (3) years clinical experience as an RN in the operating room required, including experience with electronic EMR. Other surgical services experience may be considered. </li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience developing and delivering presentations in a group setting required.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience with computer programs such as Microsoft Office (PowerPoint, Word, Excel, and Outlook).<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience with clinical education and teaching adult learners is preferred.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience with learning management systems is preferred.</li></ul><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Schedule:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Monday – Friday, primarily day shift.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">On call as needed.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Please let me know if you have any questions.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">People Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">tidalhealth.org</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}